                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does anniversary gifting drive for jewelry brands?</h3>
                                        <p>15-25% of annual revenue distributed year-round. Milestone years peak higher.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I collect customer anniversary dates?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — CRM + date-triggered reminder infrastructure lifts anniversary revenue 30-50%. Data collection + reminder essential.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest anniversary marketing lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Milestone year recognition + reminder infrastructure + regional cultural adaptation combined. Not one-size-fits-all playbook.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Valentine's Day or anniversary bigger?</h3>
                                        <p>Anniversary distributed year-round > Valentine single-day peak for most gifting D2C. Combined + both matter.</p>
